Origin: applejack, https://github.com/mattsp1290/applejack/tree/main/build/wine/patches, adapted from https://github.com/cyyever/wine/commit/c5375ee66cb355bb949d60e952da3bf9323d7bc3 by cyy (written for Wine 11.9, see https://github.com/3Shain/dxmt/issues/170). LGPL-2.1-or-later, as Wine.
Date: 2026-10-31
Reason: DXMT 0.80 finds macdrv_functions through dlsym(RTLD_DEFAULT) and reads a Wine 8.16 window data layout. Wine 11.0 exports no such table and has no client view until a client surface exists, so every D3D11 swap chain fails with "Failed to create metal view".
Drop-when: the pinned Wine and DXMT both carry the upstream route (dxmt PR 166 and its Wine merge request), or DXMT stops reading macdrv_win_data.

